@@ -0,0 +1,1485 @@
+// Nozzle It All engine: PrusaSlicer 2.9.6's virtual extruders ("Full Spectrum" colour mixing, namespace FullSpectrum),
+// ported from PrusaSlicer 2.9.6 (tag version_2.9.6, prusa3d/PrusaSlicer), src/libslic3r/Feature/FullSpectrum/VirtualExtruder.cpp.
+// Copyright (c) Prusa Research s.r.o. and the PrusaSlicer contributors; licensed under the GNU Affero General Public
